a8950","priority":0.4125,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Executor greps for 'rebar review' and matches the freshly-added review-plan/review-code lines, producing a false positive or masking a residual stale reference."],"severity":"major","suggested_fix":"State the exact anchored pattern in Testing, e.g. `grep -rnE 'rebar review([^-]|$)' AGENTS.md docs/` returning no maintained-doc hits, and define 'historical records' (e.g. release notes / changelog paths) that are excluded.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.75,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"no","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"underspecified_oracle","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"medium","prod_impact":"none","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"silent","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"low"}}},{"block_threshold":0.75,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Re-locate the actual AGENTS.md text that instructs invoking `rebar review` (line 225 is the unrelated MCP-tools bullet; lines 238-240 already mark the verb deprecated), or drop AGENTS.md from scope if no such instruction exists.","cohort":["E4"],"criteria":["E4"],"decision":"dropped","decision_margin":0.1,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["AGENTS.md:224-225: '**MCP tool set** — the read/write tool inventory and their `outputSchema`s → `docs/mcp-reference.md`.'","AGENTS.md:238-240 already states the `review` verb 'is deprecated and now forwards to `review-plan`'","grep of AGENTS.md for 'rebar review' returns only review-plan/review-code lines and line 395 `rebar explain review` — no bare `rebar review` invocation instruction"],"finding":"The plan's premise that 'AGENTS.md:225 still advertises rebar review' is refuted by Read/Grep. AGENTS.md:225 is the 'MCP tool set' bullet (→ docs/mcp-reference.md), unrelated to the review command. A full grep of AGENTS.md for 'review' finds no instruction to invoke `rebar review`; the file already documents the deprecation at lines 238-240 ('the old single-pass `review` verb is deprecated and now forwards to `review-plan`'), and the only literal 'rebar review' is line 395's `rebar explain review` (the guide-explain verb, not the removed command).","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f5f5c32847f10ef9c","impact":0.85,"is_primary":null,"location":"Context / Problem — 'AGENTS.md:225 ... still advertise rebar review'","norm_id":"n23cc7ea26b5a1f1f","priority":0.85,"reason":"veto:cited-reference-inaccurate","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Author edits AGENTS.md:225 expecting to find retired `rebar review` guidance and finds an unrelated MCP-tools bullet, or concludes AGENTS.md already satisfies AC-1 with no edit needed"],"severity":"critical","suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":1.0,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"yes","cited_reference_accurate":"no","claims_absence":"no","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"yes","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"yes","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"yes","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"yes","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impac